# To Paste a Peiste (abyssea 164): a level 99 Warrior in Konschtat Highlands by the Cavernous Maw with The Truth Beckons
# completed and Dawn of Death accepted (GMs), no Traverser Stone, 1 maw quest completed (A Goldstruck Gigas) and
# Megadrile Menace accepted (GMs; an accepted one does not count). The maw, no stone: no section: its own warp event 107
# (entranceMawOnTrigger), finished on option 0: no warp. Traverser Stone 2 (a GM, one stone: `>= 1`): 0 (a Progress),
# finished on option 0: begun. Back to available (a GM): the maw again with no other talk between: 0 again (an Event-
# rank 0 would alternate with the maw's own onTrigger: 107), finished on option 2: begun (any option). Accepted: the
# maw: no handler: 107. A zone-in, accepted with no Kukulkan title: nothing. The title (a GM): the zone-in plays 1 (left
# open); its update on option 0 and on option 2: nothing; on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 1 completed: Ivory
# Abyssite of Fortune); finished: Ivory Abyssite of Fortune given, then completed. Completed (title, stone and Dawn of
# Death still held): a zone-in: nothing; the maw: 107.
lists KonschtatHighlands/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger KonschtatHighlands/onEventFinish/0 KonschtatHighlands/onEventFinish/107 KonschtatHighlands/onZoneIn/1 KonschtatHighlands/onEventUpdate/1 KonschtatHighlands/onEventFinish/1
char zone=KonschtatHighlands pos=96.844,-69.08,-580.008 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace accepted
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # no stone: no section: the maw's warp event 107
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
keyitem TraverserStone2                 # a GM: one stone
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # available, one stone, Dawn of Death accepted: 0
finish                                  # option 0: begun
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste available  # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 0 again (the kind)
finish option=2                         # begun (any option)
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # accepted: no maw handler: 107
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
rezone                                  # accepted, no title: nothing
title KukulkanDefanger                  # a GM
rezone open                             # the title: 1, left open
update 1 option=0                       # option 0: nothing
update 1 option=2                       # option 2: nothing
update 1 option=1                       # option 1: updateEvent(Ivory Abyssite of Fortune)
finish                                  # Ivory Abyssite of Fortune given; completed
rezone                                  # completed: nothing
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # completed: no section: 107
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
